## 7. 🚀 Deployment — 100% Free Cloud

| Component | Platform | Free Tier Details |
|-----------|----------|-------------------|
| Frontend (Next.js) | **Vercel** | Unlimited free deploys, custom domain, CDN |
| Backend (FastAPI) | **Render** | 750 free hrs/month, auto-deploy from GitHub |
| Celery Worker | **Render** (separate service) | Background worker service, free tier |
| Redis (broker) | **Upstash Redis** | 10,000 commands/day free, serverless |
| PostgreSQL | **Supabase** | 500MB free, includes Auth + REST API |
| MongoDB | **MongoDB Atlas** | 512MB free M0 cluster |
| Vector DB | **ChromaDB** | In-memory on Render (persistent via Render disk) |
| Video Storage | **Cloudflare R2** | 10GB free, zero egress cost |
| LLM | **Groq API** | Free tier — Llama 3 70B, very fast |
| AI Models (Whisper etc.) | **Hugging Face Inference API** | Free tier available |
| CI/CD | **GitHub Actions** | Free for public repos |

### Deployment Flow
```
Developer pushes to GitHub main branch
       │
       ├── Vercel auto-detects → builds + deploys Next.js frontend
       └── Render auto-detects → builds + deploys FastAPI + Celery worker
```

### Environment Variables Needed
```
GROQ_API_KEY=...
SUPABASE_URL=...
SUPABASE_KEY=...
MONGODB_URI=...
CLOUDFLARE_R2_ACCESS_KEY=...
CLOUDFLARE_R2_SECRET_KEY=...
CLOUDFLARE_R2_BUCKET=...
UPSTASH_REDIS_URL=...
JWT_SECRET=...
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=...
```

