## 10. 🗺️ 12-Week Build Roadmap

| Weeks | Milestone |
|-------|-----------|
| 1–2 | Project setup, auth (JWT + Google OAuth), video upload to Cloudflare R2 |
| 3–4 | Celery + Redis setup, Whisper transcription pipeline |
| 5 | Speaker diarization (pyannote) + emotion detection (RoBERTa) |
| 6 | Sentence-BERT embeddings + ChromaDB storage |
| 7 | RAG chat engine (Groq API + retrieval) |
| 8 | Chapter segmentation (TextTiling) + LLM summarization |
| 9 | Frontend: video player + chat panel + chapter navigation |
| 10 | Frontend: emotion timeline + transcript view + search |
| 11 | LLaVA visual frame analysis integration + YouTube import |
| 12 | Polish UI, deploy to Vercel + Render, create demo video |

